		RETURNF "돌격소총"
	CASE "Bolt-Action Rifle"
		RETURNF "볼트액션 소총"
	CASE "Sniper Rifle"
		RETURNF "저격소총"
	CASE "Anti-Material Rifle"
		RETURNF "대물 소총"
	CASE "Shotgun"
		RETURNF "산탄총"
